---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import JsonPatchGeneratorApp from '../../../components/tools/JsonPatchGeneratorApp';
---
<Layout lang="ko" title="온라인 RFC 6902 JSON 패치 생성기 — 무료 작업 패치" description="두 JSON 객체에서 표준 RFC 6902 작업 패치(add, remove, replace, move)를 1클릭으로 생성하세요." activeTab="tools" canonicalPath="/tools/json-patch-generator"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10"><div class="mb-8"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:bg-[#16181d] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#39393b] dark:text-[#b5b5b8] mb-3 border border-[#e5e5e5] dark:border-[#22242a]"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#111111] dark:bg-[#f0f0f2]"></span>개발자 유틸리티</div><h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] uppercase">RFC 6902 JSON 패치 생성기</h1><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#4b4b4d] dark:text-[#9ca3af] max-w-2xl">두 JSON 객체에서 표준 RFC 6902 작업 패치(add, remove, replace, move, copy, test)를 1클릭으로 생성하세요. 브라우저에서 100% 로컬로 실행됩니다.</p></div><JsonPatchGeneratorApp client:load lang="ko" /></div></Layout>
